      "value": "P.S. The problem seems to occur only when an image link is generated in a post with the world url alone in the post or with only a text comment added.\n\nThe reference for that image link is to a video.\n\nIf the url is added to the post along with other images (i.e., the image link is not generated, but is a textual url link), this problem does not occur and the link works as a normal link to the web site.",
